9
00:36:33,750 --> 00:36:39,750
A Fairly Odd Christmas (also known as A Fairly Odd Movie 2) is a 2012
American live-action/animated Christmas comedy television film.

10
00:40:37,500 --> 00:40:43,500
It is the sequel to the 2011 live-action TV film A
Fairly Odd Movie: Grow Up, Timmy Turner!

11
00:44:41,250 --> 00:44:47,250
and the second live-action adaptation of the Nickelodeon
animated television series The Fairly OddParents.

12
00:48:45,000 --> 00:48:51,000
The film was first announced on March 14, 2012.

13
00:52:48,750 --> 00:52:54,750
The film premiered on Nickelodeon on November 29,
2012, to 4.473 million viewers.

14
00:56:52,500 --> 00:56:58,500
The film was released on Region 1 DVD on December 17, 2013, and
was released on Blu-ray on December 4, 2015.

15
01:00:56,250 --> 01:01:02,250
The film explores themes of holiday, christmas, live action and animation.
